n dimensions: 23 m × 17 m\n- Path width: 1.5 m on all sides\n- Outer dimensions: (23 + 1.5 + 1.5) × (17 + 1.5 + 1.5) = (23 + 3) × (17 + 3) = 26 × 20\n\nArea with path: 26 × 20 = 520 m²\nArea without path: 23 × 17 = 391 m²\nArea of path: 520 - 391 = 129 m²"},"reasoning_state":{"provider":"openrouter","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"The garden measures 23 m by 17 m.\n\nA path 1.5 m wide runs all the way around the outside of the garden.\n\nI need to find the area of just the path.\n\nThe total area including the path would be:\n- The outer dimensions would be: (23 + 2(1.5)) by (17 + 2(1.5))\n- That's (23 + 3) by (17 + 3) = 26 by 20\n\nArea of garden plus path = 26 × 20 = 520 square meters\n\nArea of just the garden = 23 × 17 = 391 square meters\n\nArea of the path = 520 - 391 = 129 square meters\n\nLet me double-check:\n- Garden dimensions: 23 m × 17 m\n- Path width: 1.5 m on all sides\n- Outer dimensions: (23 + 1.5 + 1.5) × (17 + 1.5 + 1.5) = (23 + 3) × (17 + 3) = 26 × 20\n\nArea with path: 26 × 20 = 520 m²\nArea without path: 23 × 17 = 391 m²\nArea of path: 520 - 391 = 129 m²","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":""}]}},{"text":25,"prompt":24,"fill_history":{"=reasoning_effort":66,"question":26},"llm":{"key":"ddc253f3-0e4c-4151-80a0-adc1a337810c","name":"GPT-5.4 Mini","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/openai/gpt-5.4-mini","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"GPT-5.4 Mini","model":"openai/gpt-5.4-mini","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"text","tools":"","tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":"","max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"settings":{"system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":{"type":"text"},"tools":[],"tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":[],"max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":