ds, units or working.\n\n{question}","LLM_0":"Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite","reasoning":"**Calculating Outer Dimensions**\n\nI've begun by establishing the inner rectangle's dimensions and the path width. My current focus is on computing the outer dimensions, accounting for the path encircling the garden. This involves adding twice the path width to both the length and width.\n\n"},"reasoning_state":{"provider":"openrouter","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"**Calculating Outer Dimensions**\n\nI've begun by establishing the inner rectangle's dimensions and the path width. My current focus is on computing the outer dimensions, accounting for the path encircling the garden. This involves adding twice the path width to both the length and width.\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0}]}},{"text":25,"prompt":24,"fill_history":{"=reasoning_effort":66,"question":26},"llm":{"key":"234aef5b-0529-4cc3-bf54-2c4b6b76dabc","name":"DeepSeek V4 Flash","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"DeepSeek V4 Flash","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"text","tools":"","tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":"","max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"settings":{"system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":{"type":"text"},"tools":[],"tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":[],"max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"progress":{"success":95.83333333333334,"error":0}},"uid":"67e9b896-12a1-4550-8418-05a5b3f8967b","metavars":{"Expected":25,"__pt":"{=reasoning_effort}Reply with only the final answer as a number, with no words, units or working.\n\n{question}","LLM_0":"DeepSeek V4 Flash","reasoning":"We need to find area of path around rectangular garden. Garden dimensions: 23 m by 17 m. Path width 1.5 m around outside. So outer rectangle dimensions: length = 23 + 2*1.5 = 23+3 = 26 m, width = 17 + 2*1.5 = 17+3 = 20 m. Area of outer rectangle = 26*20 = 520 sq m. Area of garden = 23*17 = 391 sq m. Area of path = outer area - garden area = 520 - 391 = 129 sq m. Answer: 129."},"reasoning_state":{"provider":"openrouter","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"We need to find area of path around rectangular garden. Garden dimensions: 23 m by 17 m. Path width 1.5 m around outside. So outer rectangle dimensions: length = 23 + 2*1.5 = 23+3 = 26 m, width = 17 + 2*1.5 = 17+3 = 20 m. Area of outer rectangle = 26*20 = 520 sq m. Area of garden = 23*17 = 391 sq m. Area of path = outer area - garden area = 520 - 391 = 129 sq m. Answer: 129.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},{"text":16,"prompt":13,"fill_history":{"=reasoning_effort":66,"question":15},"llm":{"key":"0345fefe-6f71-4ebe-bd3c-f10956f23da0","name":"Claude Haiku 4.5","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"Claude Haiku 4.5","model":"anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"text","tools":"","tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":"","max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"settings":{"system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":{"type":"text"},"tools":[],"tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":[],"max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"progress":{"success":100,"error":0}},"uid":"a027a35c-f6ab-4ac5-a025-88d9bef4e2bf","metavars":{"Expected":16,"__pt":"{=reasoning_effort}Reply with only the final answer as a number, with no words, units or working.\n\n{question}","LLM_0":"Claude Haiku 4.5","reasoning":"Let me set up the problem.\n\nInitial ratio of walkers to bus takers is 5:7.\n\nSo let's say:\n- Walkers = 5k\n- Bus takers = 7k\n\nfor some constant k.\n\nAfter 6 walkers switch to taking the bus:\n- Walkers = 5k - 6\n- Bus takers = 7k + 6\n\nThe new ratio is 1:2, so:\n(5k - 6)/(7k + 6) = 1/2\n\nCross multiply:\n2(5k - 6) = 1(7k + 6)\n10k - 12 = 7k + 6\n3k = 18\nk = 6\n\nSo initially:\n- Walkers = 5(6) = 30\n- Bus takers = 7(6) = 42\n\nTotal students = 30 + 42 = 72\n\nLet me verify:\nAfter 6 walkers switch:\n- Walkers = 30 - 6 = 24\n- Bus takers = 42 + 6 = 48\n\nRatio = 24:48 = 1:2 ✓\n\nTotal students = 72"},"reasoning_state":{"provider":"openrouter","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me set up the problem.\n\nInitial ratio of walkers to bus takers is 5:7.\n\nSo let's say:\n- Walkers = 5k\n- Bus takers = 7k\n\nfor some constant k.\n\nAfter 6 walkers switch to taking the bus:\n- Walkers = 5k - 6\n- Bus takers = 7k + 6\n\nThe new ratio is 1:2, so:\n(5k - 6)/(7k + 6) = 1/2\n\nCross multiply:\n2(5k - 6) = 1(7k + 6)\n10k - 12 = 7k + 6\n3k = 18\nk = 6\n\nSo initially:\n- Walkers = 5(6) = 30\n- Bus takers = 7(6) = 42\n\nTotal students = 30 + 42 = 72\n\nLet me verify:\nAfter 6 walkers switch:\n- Walkers = 30 - 6 = 24\n- Bus takers = 42 + 6 = 48\n\nRatio = 24:48 = 1:2 ✓\n\nTotal students = 72","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":""}]}},{"text":16,"prompt":13,"fill_history":{"=reasoning_effort":66,"question":15},"llm":{"key":"ddc253f3-0e4c-4151-80a0-adc1a337810c","name":"GPT-5.4 Mini","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/openai/gpt-5.4-mini","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"GPT-5.4 Mini","model":"openai/gpt-5.4-mini","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"text","tools":"","tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":"","max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"settings":{"system_msg":"You are a helpfu