 sheds = 28 worker-days per shed\n\nNow, for 5 sheds, I need:\n5 sheds × 28 worker-days per shed = 140 worker-days\n\nIf 4 workers are working:\n140 worker-days ÷ 4 workers = 35 days\n\nLet me verify this:\n- 7 workers, 12 days, 3 sheds\n- Rate: (7 × 12) / 3 = 84/3 = 28 worker-days per shed\n- For 5 sheds with 28 worker-days per shed: 5 × 28 = 140 worker-days needed\n- With 4 workers: 140 / 4 = 35 days\n\nYes, that's correct."},"reasoning_state":{"provider":"openrouter","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me work through this step by step.\n\nIf 7 workers build 3 sheds in 12 days, I need to find the rate of work.\n\nFirst, let me find the total \"worker-days\" needed to build 3 sheds:\n7 workers × 12 days = 84 worker-days for 3 sheds\n\nSo the rate is: 84 worker-days / 3 sheds = 28 worker-days per shed\n\nNow, for 5 sheds, I need:\n5 sheds × 28 worker-days per shed = 140 worker-days\n\nIf 4 workers are working:\n140 worker-days ÷ 4 workers = 35 days\n\nLet me verify this:\n- 7 workers, 12 days, 3 sheds\n- Rate: (7 × 12) / 3 = 84/3 = 28 worker-days per shed\n- For 5 sheds with 28 worker-days per shed: 5 × 28 = 140 worker-days needed\n- With 4 workers: 140 / 4 = 35 days\n\nYes, that's correct.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":""}]}},{"text":35,"prompt":34,"fill_history":{"=reasoning_effort":66,"question":36},"llm":{"key":"ddc253f3-0e4c-4151-80a0-adc1a337810c","name":"GPT-5.4 Mini","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/openai/gpt-5.4-mini","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"GPT-5.4 Mini","model":"openai/gpt-5.4-mini","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"text","tools":"","tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":"","max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"settings":{"system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_for