se_format":{"type":"text"},"tools":[],"tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":[],"max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"progress":{"success":100,"error":0}},"uid":"066f02a1-eff3-427e-bf67-df9d8f4af9a3"},{"text":30,"prompt":27,"fill_history":{"=reasoning_effort":66,"question":29},"metavars":{"Expected":30,"__pt":"{=reasoning_effort}Reply with only the final answer as a number, with no words, units or working.\n\n{question}","LLM_0":"DeepSeek V4 Flash","reasoning":"We need to compute total time in minutes from 9:47 AM.\n\nFirst leg: distance 315 km, speed 84 km/h. Time = distance/speed = 315/84 hours. Simplify: 315/84 = (105*3)/(28*3) = 105/28 = 15/4 = 3.75 hours = 3 hours and 0.75*60 = 45 minutes. So 3h45m.\n\nThen stop: 23 minutes.\n\nSecond leg: distance 145 km, speed 116 km/h. Time = 145/116 hours. Simplify: divide numerator and denominator by 29: 145/29=5, 116/29=4, so 5/4 = 1.25 hours = 1 hour and 0.25*60=15 minutes. So 1h15m.\n\nTotal time = 3h45m + 23m + 1h15m = (3h+1h) + (45m+23m+15m) = 4h + 83m = 4h + 1h23m = 5h23m.\n\nSo arrival is 5 hours and 23 minutes after 9:47 AM. That gives 9:47 + 5h = 14:47, then +23m = 15:10. But the question asks \"How many minutes after 9:47 AM does it arrive?\" So total minutes = 5*60 + 23 = 300 + 23 = 323 minutes.\n\nThus answer is 323."},"reasoning_state":{"provider":"openrouter","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"We need to compute total time in minutes from 9:47 AM.\n\nFirst leg: distance 315 km, speed 84 km/h. Time = distance/speed = 315/84 hours. Simplify: 315/84 = (105*3)/(28*3) = 105/28 = 15/4 = 3.75 hours = 3 hours and 0.75*60 = 45 minutes. So 3h45m.\n\nThen stop: 23 minutes.\n\nSecond leg: distance 145 km, speed 116 km/h. Time = 145/116 hours. Simplify: divide numerator and denominator by 29: 145/29=5, 116/29=4, so 5/4 = 1.25 hours = 1 hour and 0.25*60=15 minutes. So 1h15m.\n\nTotal time = 3h45m + 23m + 1h15m = (3h+1h) + (45m+23m+15m) = 4h + 83m = 4h + 1h23m = 5h23m.\n\nSo arrival is 5 hours and 23 minutes after 9:47 AM. That gives 9:47 + 5h = 14:47, then +23m = 15:10. But the question asks \"How many minutes after 9:47 AM does it arrive?\" So total minutes = 5*60 + 23 = 300 + 23 = 323 minutes.\n\nThus answer is 323.","format":"unknown","index":0}]},"llm":{"key":"234aef5b-0529-4cc3-bf54-2c4b6b76dabc","name":"DeepSeek V4 Flash","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"DeepSeek V4 Flash","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"text","tools":"","tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":"","max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"settings":{"system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":{"type":"text"},"tools":[],"tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":[],"max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"progress":{"success":95.83333333333334,"error":0}},"uid":"a1202adc-87d2-451d-b5c0-22576eced646"},{"text":4,"prompt":0,"fill_history":{"=reasoning_effort":66,"question":3},"metavars":{"Expected":4,"__pt":"{=reasoning_effort}Reply with only the final answer as a number, with no words, units or working.\n\n{question}","LLM_0":"Claude Haiku 4.5","reasoning":"Let me work through this step-by-step.\n\nInitial deposit: $2,400\nInterest rate: 5% per year (compounded annually)\nAdditional deposit: $300 at the end of each year (after interest is paid)\nTime period: 3 years\n\nYear 0 (starting): $2,400\n\nYear 1:\n- Interest earned: $2,400 × 0.05 = $120\n- After interest: $2,400 + $120 = $2,520\n- After deposit: $2,520 + $300 = $2,820\n\nYear 2:\n- Interest earned: $2,820 × 0.05 = $141\n- After interest: $2,820 + $141 = $2,961\n- After deposit: $2,961 + $300 = $3,261\n\nYear 3:\n- Interest earned: $3,261 × 0.05 = $163.05\n- After interest: $3,261 + $163.05 = $3,424.05\n- After deposit: $3,424.05 + $300 = $3,724.05\n\nRounded to the nearest dollar: $3,724\n\nLet me double-check this calculation:\n\nStart: $2,400\n\nAfter Year 1:\n$2,400 × 1.05 = $2,520\n$2,520 + $300 = $2,820\n\nAfter Year 2:\n$2,820 × 1.05 = $2,961\n$2,961 + $300 = $3,261\n\nAfter Year 3:\n$3,261 × 1.05 = $3,424.05\n$3,424.05 + $300 = $3,724.05\n\nRounded: $3,724\n\nYes, that's correct."},"reasoning_state":{"provider":"openrouter","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me work through this step-by-step.\n\nInitial deposit: $2,400\nInterest rate: 5% per year (compounded annually)\nAdditional deposit: $300 at the end of each year (after interest is paid)\nTime period: 3 years\n\nYear 0 (starting): $2,400\n\nYear 1:\n- Interest earned: $2,400 × 0.05 = $120\n- After interest: $2,400 + $120 = $2,520\n- After deposit: $2,520 + $300 = $2,820\n\nYear 2:\n- Interest earned: $2,820 × 0.05 = $141\n- After interest: $2,820 + $141 = $2,961\n- After deposit: $2,961 + $300 = $3,261\n\nYear 3:\n- Interest earned: $3,261 × 0.05 = $163.05\n- After interest: $3,261 + $163.05 = $3,424.05\n- After deposit: $3,424.05 + $300 = $3,724.05\n\nRounded to the nearest dollar: $3,724\n\nLet me double-check this calculation:\n\nStart: $2,400\n\nAfter Year 1:\n$2,400 × 1.05 = $2,520\n$2,520 + $300 = $2,820\n\nAfter Year 2:\n$2,820 × 1.05 = $2,961\n$2,961 + $300 = $3,261\n\nAfter Year 3:\n$3,261 × 1.05 = $3,424.05\n$3,424.05 + $300 = $3,724.05\n\nRounded: $3,724\n\nYes, that's correct.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":""}]},"llm":{"key":"0345fefe-6f71-4ebe-bd3c-f10956f23da0","name":"Claude Haiku 4.5","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"Claude Haiku 4.5","model":"anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"te