 sqrt(10041)]/6. sqrt(10041) approx? 100^2=10000, 100.2^2=10040.04, so about 100.2. So n ≈ (-21+100.2)/6 = 79.2/6 = 13.2. So n=14? Check n=13: S_13 = (3*169+21*13)/2 = (507+273)/2 = 780/2=390. n=14: (3*196+21*14)/2 = (588+294)/2 = 882/2=441. So day 14 first reaches at least 400. Answer: 14."},"reasoning_state":{"provider":"openrouter","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"We need to find the day when the cumulative sum of an arithmetic sequence reaches at least 400. First day: 12 pages. Each subsequent day: 3 more than previous. So pages on day n: a_n = 12 + (n-1)*3 = 3n + 9? Check: n=1: 3*1+9=12, yes. Sum of first n days: S_n = n/2 * (first + last) = n/2 * (12 + (3n+9)) = n/2 * (3n+21) = n*(3n+21)/2 = (3n^2+21n)/2. Set >=400: (3n^2+21n)/2 >=400 => 3n^2+21n >=800 => 3n^2+21n-800>=0. Solve quadratic: n = [-21 ± sqrt(441 + 9600)]/(6) = [-21 ± sqrt(10041)]/6. sqrt(10041) approx? 100^2=10000, 100.2^2=10040.04, so about 100.2. So n ≈ (-21+100.2)/6 = 79.2/6 = 13.2. So n=14? Check n=13: S_13 = (3*169+21*13)/2 = (507+273)/2 = 780/2=390. n=14: (3*196+21*14)/2 = (588+294)/2 = 882/2=441. So day 14 first reaches at least 400. Answer: 14.","format":"unknown","index":0}]},"llm":{"key":"234aef5b-0529-4cc3-bf54-2c4b6b76dabc","name":"DeepSeek V4 Flash","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"DeepSeek V4 Flash","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"text","tools":"","tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":"","max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"settings":{"system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":{"type":"text"},"tools":[],"tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":[],"max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"progress":