 34 miles per gallon.\nGas costs $3.89 per gallon.\nRound trip where each way is 287 miles.\n\nTotal distance = 287 × 2 = 574 miles\n\nGallons needed = 574 ÷ 34 = 16.882352941... gallons\n\nCost = 16.882352941... × $3.89\n\nLet me calculate this more carefully:\n574 ÷ 34 = 16.882352941176...\n\n16.882352941176... × 3.89 = 65.792352941... \n\nLet me recalculate:\n574 / 34 = 16.88235294117647...\n\n16.88235294117647 × 3.89 = 65.79235294...\n\nLet me be more precise:\n574 / 34 = 287/17 = 16.88235294117647058823529411764705882...\n\n287/17 × 3.89 = 287 × 3.89 / 17 = 1116.43 / 17 = 65.67235294...\n\nLet me recalculate 287 × 3.89:\n287 × 3.89 = 287 × 3 + 287 × 0.89\n= 861 + 255.43\n= 1116.43\n\n1116.43 / 17 = 65.672352...\n\nRounding to the nearest cent: $65.67\n\nWait, let me double-check my calculation of 287 × 0.89:\n287 × 0.89 = 287 × (1 - 0.11) = 287 - 287 × 0.11 = 287 - 31.57 = 255.43\n\nSo 287 × 3.89 = 287 × 4 - 287 × 0.11 = 1148 - 31.57 = 1116.43\n1116.43 / 17 gives me 17 × 65 = 1105, with 11.43 remaining, so 11.43 / 17 = 0.6723529..., making the total 65.6723529... which rounds to $65.67.\n\nLet me verify this using gallons instead. 574 miles / 34 mpg = 16.88235294... gallons. Multiplying by $3.89 per gallon: 16 × $3.89 = $62.24, and 0.88235294 × $3.89 ≈ $3.4323529..., giving $65.6723529... or $65.67 when rounded. I should double-check the division 574 ÷ 34 more carefully—34 × 16 = 544, leaving 30 as the remainder.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":""}]},"llm":{"key":"0345fefe-6f71-4ebe-bd3c-f10956f23da0","name":"Claude Haiku 4.5","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"Claude Haiku 4.5","model":"anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"text","tools":"","tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":"","max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequen