m":"DeepSeek V4 Flash","prompt":45,"responses":[112],"uid":"48131f46-64ab-4562-adff-448d52e0f0d1","reasoning":[113],"reasoning_state":[{"provider":"openrouter","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"We need answer. Need compute. Car mpg 34, gas $3.89/gal, round trip each way 287 miles => total distance 574 miles. Gallons = 574/34 = 287/17 = 16.88235294117647. Cost = gallons * 3.89 = 16.88235294117647 * 3.89. Calculate: 16.88235294 * 3.89. 16.88235294*4 = 67.52941176; minus *0.11 = 1.85705882; = 65.67235294. Round nearest cent = $65.67. Need final as number only: 65.67.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}]},{"vars":{"=reasoning_effort":66,"question":36},"metavars":{"Expected":35,"__pt":"{=reasoning_effort}Reply with only the final answer as a number, with no words, units or working.\n\n{question}","LLM_0":"Claude Haiku 4.5"},"llm":"Claude Haiku 4.5","prompt":34,"responses":[35],"uid":"41223ebe-b78c-46a3-90ac-de26950ab7dd","reasoning":[80],"reasoning_state":[{"provider":"openrouter","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me work through this step by step.\n\nIf 7 workers build 3 sheds in 12 days, I need to find the rate of work.\n\nFirst, let me find the total \"worker-days\" needed to build 3 sheds:\n7 workers × 12 days = 84 worker-days for 3 sheds\n\nSo the rate is: 84 worker-days / 3 sheds = 28 worker-days per shed\n\nNow, for 5 sheds, I need:\n5 sheds × 28 worker-days per shed = 140 worker-days\n\nIf 4 workers are working:\n140 worker-days ÷ 4 workers = 35 days\n\nLet me verify this:\n- 7 workers, 12 days, 3 sheds\n- Rate: (7 × 12) / 3 = 84/3 = 28 worker-days per shed\n- For 5 sheds with 28 worker-days per shed: 5 × 28 = 140 worker-days needed\n- With 4 workers: 140 / 4 = 35 days\n\nYes, that's correct.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":""}]}]},{"vars":{"=reasoning_effort":66,"question":36},"metavars":{"Expected":35,"__pt":"{=reasoning_effort}Reply with only the final answer as a number, with no words, units or working.\n\n{question}","LLM_0":"GPT-5.4 Mini"},"llm":"GPT-5.4 Mini","prompt":34,"responses":[35],"uid":"85507c88-f806-4e60-83bc-a4a0acac2763","reasoning":[98],"reasoning_state":[{"provider":"openrouter","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.summary","summary":"**Calculating worker-days needed**\n\nI’m figuring out the worker-days needed for the project. Seven workers over twelve days gives me 84 worker-days, which needs to be divided among three sheds, meaning 28 worker-days per shed. If we have five sheds, that totals 140 worker-days. With four working days assigned, that leaves me needing 35. I realize I just need to present the final number, so here I go!","format":"openai-responses-v1","index":0},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABqq1SCY_utV8vElAlDM48foH6BSYCLlJ9Zwf9_6_Zro0ewO1r9F52qlePlMGc60Sz9MfYqqNfqBulQyl43UVupGCYQYClPpv0XrZShGyXDDWBnvu7Y-6MSGeV8Y2PYTZSYzaFG0IcJ5uFdgG2fAWbPaurcNHUUTn2-FEJSu_3KJjsXRqNoF3hnawwsQOkQe7r4MB0WiLDPksZpV85v-R1RNOgGqK30vL00KuYM2VTr7hbi668vty2UAF2ijpEWNSAazN1eMYk6SsLyW4bzCAtI6JxQczP0UNd__0z88vLLksTZr6uGNTvNQzxMn2YR1lA8IMzP32XBHXjwwUKWUAKvZsQQCoC_EwhuBu0UjZUwrqWA7-h7XDN-79KlojNisid5K5bx2u8VhdL5NcrBXWy_nf7lJ7HWFOYXVmPKdfJfrXyh5yBO0OCFiOvloMCA8XfkAbu6-t4ya62BFGlQgZhCDIksebea66dm7WhUSz112h5tKBuq_QwavRyvSVZQeZaSomrhirP_C6YEak1pMNf_yXk9nnQIxURoAsSYz0P8yy1CvNhJIBTe1a5WzDAEKRuIu794ZNy83h8EcZAJOTUg1Y7H7cJs_gNjKJczzS2eMYLARsbpauE_56o825oRDn4HNUeA2ob4qBfWGOyxrfyo3GQbEbGpf2gh4BzJV6noxjmL2vsfnza09QMFJYVR7nA3JS_yUl4wxZTTFUMY6A3HSUsh4iMWVvXMaABBbkALR1hXZ4DgflGVfnzaaffV9_R_lD10mdN46GL8W43lOOek9a0PF0sCgDehdq7c4ZvKc8MT7bF3QFyH9IkjMxN1-89bJflfmwVY0KlgRSGviGjTt-9vLLNnIud5jJaXNYN95jJHJ6ISceeTmMaOHtfXEp5k5yMJBSd-uptrqFGc3qPKqLOSS24khJg-LFYSyG33dyAP8lfwzBmgaOKewMTs9zPvjklpn4ijNnVDx8dBgoe8oNha946vHyEgcHbIYn_LUiCehQJVokfYye-U2l4V77K6qMm-HSBdZG1S6u42sGC0g-Qko24H1r6_PUMnPDDblRhHdOBPutWV_SfqdNIb909Bpj9RvJWsQOpSszhZKJLFS60p__iYI0c9t4PdmgJsXJb_yIyfKuYkleWDNkiIncUOPfDmtCUg2LE2MeqU0M0yNIopfjF5yW_vAmX-rAuSj6JLSZwcNpGX6-WYVjHGiXFKKXVNtnJLIZwKScP8flOLi486zTX