days\n\nTotal = 29 + 30 + 31 + 30 + 31 + 31 + 30 + 31 + 19\n\nLet me add these up:\n29 + 30 = 59\n59 + 31 = 90\n90 + 30 = 120\n120 + 31 = 151\n151 + 31 = 182\n182 + 30 = 212\n212 + 31 = 243\n243 + 19 = 262\n\nSo the answer is 262 days.\n\nLet me double-check this calculation:\n- March 3 to March 31: 29 days\n- April: 30 days\n- May: 31 days\n- June: 30 days\n- July: 31 days\n- August: 31 days\n- September: 30 days\n- October: 31 days\n- November 1 to November 19: 19 days\n\n29 + 30 + 31 + 30 + 31 + 31 + 30 + 31 + 19 = 262\nThat confirms it—262 days total.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":""}]}],"eval_res":{"items":[true],"dtype":"Categorical"}},{"vars":{"=reasoning_effort":66,"question":53},"metavars":{"Expected":52,"__pt":"{=reasoning_effort}Reply with only the final answer as a number, with no words, units or working.\n\n{question}","LLM_0":"GPT-5.4 Mini","reasoning":"**Calculating inclusive days between dates**\n\nI need to compute the inclusive days between March 3 and November 19 in 2024, which is a leap year. \n\nMarch 3 is the 63rd day of the year. For November 19, I’ll add up the days: January 31 + February 29 gives me 61 days, and through October 31, there are 305 days. So November 19 is the 324th day. The inclusive difference is 324 minus 63 plus 1, which gives me 262 days. I can double-check using the monthly sum, which also confirms that it's 262!"},"uid":"2eb73314-0742-497a-9d07-7b3edd7f8e08","llm":{"key":"ddc253f3-0e4c-4151-80a0-adc1a337810c","name":"GPT-5.4 Mini","emoji":"🔀","model":"openrouter/openai/gpt-5.4-mini","base_model":"openrouter","temp":1,"formData":{"shortname":"GPT-5.4 Mini","model":"openai/gpt-5.4-mini","system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","temperature":1,"reasoning_effort":"off","reasoning_max_tokens":null,"response_format":"text","tools":"","tool_choice":"","top_p":1,"stop":"","max_tokens":null,"seed":null,"presence_penalty":0,"frequency_penalty":0},"settings":{"system_msg":"You are a helpful assistant.","te